{"id": "19519763ab00306d7c2f4844684eafa7", "text": "Summary:  The previous verse alluded to the difference s amongst \nindividual souls and between individual soul s and the Lord. This verse \npurports to answer many questions that may arise from superficial \ninterpretations in scriptures that seem to indicate identity among individual \nsouls and the Lord. Sri Rayaru in GV quotes Sri Madhwacharya\u2019s GTN  and \nadvances five arguments to illustrate the difference between individual \nsouls and the Lord.", "embedding": [-0.04045487567782402, 0.09359356015920639, -0.052992235869169235, 0.017816772684454918, 0.02717461809515953, 0.03864764794707298, 0.09861328452825546, -0.06350180506706238, 0.08456435799598694, -0.00575773511081934, 0.010330148041248322, 0.0018199416808784008, -0.04469415172934532, -0.07806091010570526, 0.040124788880348206, -0.050608374178409576, -0.052772194147109985, -0.00014277908485382795, -0.04559602215886116, 0.013553516007959843, 0.009349433705210686, 0.018556183204054832, -0.06605738401412964, 0.0268631000071764, 0.005503578577190638, -0.008458884432911873, 0.07159388810396194, -0.008230920881032944, 0.016127560287714005, 0.040637873113155365, 0.015931813046336174, 0.0302458256483078, -0.03288566321134567, 0.0292093213647604, -0.07066605985164642, 0.049721311777830124, 0.01801348850131035, 0.09429646283388138, 0.060368623584508896, -0.028211036697030067, -0.02742444910109043, 0.0003132567508146167, -0.0866759791970253, -0.029429590329527855, 0.016580425202846527, -0.04816851019859314, -0.09469813108444214, -0.0019575587939471006, 0.025643492117524147, -0.03151992708444595, -0.06503728032112122, -0.03534935787320137, -0.0609080009162426, 0.004684086889028549, -0.025998597964644432, 0.015418690629303455, -0.0331147201359272, -0.012362384237349033, -0.029550032690167427, -0.03889191523194313, -0.030982624739408493, -0.014752669259905815, 0.03749430552124977, 0.05146503821015358, 0.10505184531211853, -0.10046849399805069, 0.07981893420219421